error_signature: "undefined reference to .pcap"
root_cause: "OHOS 的 uname 返回 HarmonyOS，CMake 判定 UNIX=false，CMakeLists.txt 中 if(UNIX) 分支的 POSIX 源码被静默丢弃——configure 期无报错，仅链接/运行期 undefined reference 或功能缺失。tshark 4.6.7 实测：capture 库 POSIX capture 源被丢弃；4.4.16 归档曾因 CMake 平台问题 failed。"
rec_approach: "平台判定条件 if(UNIX) 改为 if(NOT WIN32)（OHOS 满足 POSIX 语义）；CMake 项目适配前预扫 if(UNIX)/if(APPLE)/CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME 分支逻辑并逐项对照 OHOS 环境核验。"
match_keywords: ["if(UNIX)", "CMake", "OHOS", "HarmonyOS", "POSIX", "undefined reference", "capture"]
error_excerpt: "tshark 4.6.7: capture 库 CMakeLists.txt if(UNIX) 分支在 OHOS（uname=HarmonyOS）下不生效，POSIX capture 源被丢弃（补丁 0001-capture-CMakeLists.txt.patch: if(UNIX) -> if(NOT WIN32)）"
prescan_pattern: "if\\(UNIX\\)"
severity: P1
category: platform
last_updated: 2026-09-28
